WHY TWO LICENSES
----------------

MIT is short, permissive, and universally understood.
Apache 2.0 adds an explicit patent grant and contribution terms.

Offering both lets downstream users pick whichever fits their legal situation.
This is the same arrangement used by the Rust project.
